{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>When a prince sins.</b> Inverted word order, and likewise it is אשר יחטא הנשיא, and it is connected to what precedes it, ואם כל עדת ישראל — as if it said: and if the one who sins is a prince of a tribe or a prince of a father's house."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:35.678568208Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}